justification.md
  # Professional Workstation PC - Justification

## CPU
The Intel Core i5-12500 was selected because it provides strong multitasking and productivity performance.
Its 6 cores and 12 threads are suitable for programming, office applications, and professional work.

### Alternative Component
Intel Core i5-12600 offers slightly better performance and higher clock speeds.

### Future Upgrade
Intel Core i7-14700K can significantly improve multitasking and heavy workload performance.

---

## Motherboard
The MSI PRO B760M-P DDR4 motherboard was selected because it supports modern Intel processors and DDR4 memory.
It provides stable performance and enough connectivity for workstation use.

### Alternative Component
ASRock B760M Pro RS offers additional expansion options and improved VRM cooling.

### Future Upgrade
ASUS PRIME B760M-A WIFI supports DDR5 memory and better connectivity options.

---

## RAM
32GB DDR4 3600MHz memory was selected because it is ideal for multitasking and professional software.
The higher frequency improves system responsiveness.

### Alternative Component
Kingston Fury Beast 32GB DDR4 provides similar performance and reliability.

### Future Upgrade
64GB DDR5 memory would improve performance for virtual machines and heavier workloads.

---

## Storage
The Crucial P310 1TB NVMe SSD was selected because it provides fast boot speeds and quick file transfers.
It is suitable for professional applications and large project files.

### Alternative Component
WD Blue SN5100 offers similar capacity and performance.

### Future Upgrade
A 2TB Samsung 990 EVO Plus SSD would provide more storage and faster transfer speeds.

---

## GPU
The system uses integrated Intel UHD Graphics because a dedicated GPU is not required for office work and programming.
This reduces overall system cost and power consumption.

### Alternative Component
A low-end dedicated GPU could be added for multi-monitor setups.

### Future Upgrade
An RTX graphics card could be added later for 3D rendering or GPU acceleration.

---

## Power Supply
The MSI MAG A650BN 650W PSU was selected because it provides stable power delivery and enough capacity for future upgrades.

### Alternative Component
Corsair CX650 offers similar wattage and reliability.

### Future Upgrade
Seasonic CORE GX 650W 80+ Gold would improve efficiency and long-term reliability.

---

## Case
The be quiet! PURE BASE 600 case was selected because of its silent design and good airflow.
It also provides enough space for future upgrades.

### Alternative Component
ASUS Prime AP303 offers a more modern design and improved airflow.

### Future Upgrade
A larger airflow-focused case could improve cooling performance.

---

## Monitor
The MSI PRO MP273A monitor was selected because of its IPS panel and comfortable 27-inch size.
It is suitable for productivity and long working sessions.

### Alternative Component
MSI PRO MP2412 offers a smaller and more affordable alternative.

### Future Upgrade
Dell P2725D with 1440p resolution would improve image quality and workspace.

---

## Keyboard and Mouse
The Logitech Signature K650 and M650 were selected because they provide comfortable and quiet operation.
They are suitable for long office and programming sessions.

### Alternative Component
Logitech Signature Slim K950 offers a slimmer design.

### Future Upgrade
Logitech MX Keys S and MX Master 3S provide premium productivity features.

